WwW-SiteConf-Task

The `task' generator of siteconf: `siteconf -g -G task' writes
Taskfile.yml (for Task, https://taskfile.dev/) instead of a Makefile.
See RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::Builder::Task.

It is released with WwW-SiteConf, at the same version, and needs
that version.

    perl Makefile.PL && make && make test && make install
